nable_encryption/)\n```\nsession.execute(update_query)\npsycopg2.OperationalError: server closed the connection unexpectedly\n\tThis probably means the server terminated abnormally\n\tbefore or while processing the request.\n```\nIn [PG logs](https://jenkins.dev.yugabyte.com/job/itest-system-developer/18846/artifact/logs/2.25.2.0_testfkonpartitionedtables-aws-rf3-geo-partition-enable-encryption_20250323_143558/172.151.22.250/postgresql-2025-03-23_150107.log) , i can see SIGSEGV\n```\n2025-03-23 16:16:36.932 UTC [17668] WARNING:  server process (PID 41663) was terminated by signal 11: Segmentation fault\n2025-03-23 16:16:36.932 UTC [17668] DETAIL:  Failed process was running: UPDATE range_table SET name='Updated_toUpdated_newname--62--1a5c91aa-61d5-402f-97a4-2b8143dd8a2c', age='5' WHERE name='Updated_newname--62--1a5c91aa-61d5-402f-97a4-2b8143dd8a2c' AND age='4';\n```\nand also there is below warnings in the PG logs , these warning are seen after the Alter table command and Update queries performed after the alter table\n```\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fcedd608 (17196,-1) still referenced\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fcedd608 (17196,-1) still referenced\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fcedd608 (17196,-1) still referenced\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fcedf4f8 (17154,-1) still referenced\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fced5a48 (17182,-1) still referenced\n2025-03-23 16:16:14.625 UTC [41663] WARNING:  TupleDesc reference leak: TupleDesc 0x12e9fcedb718 (17168,-1) still referenced\n```\n\nLogs for the run - \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vM87DYj0Z3ojudLZOe73z5Kq5ILJBxny?usp=drive_link\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not c